<title>USA: Plantronics sets two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>Plantronics sets two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CRUZ, Calif. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plantronics Inc said Monday that its board of directors approved a two-for-one common stock split.</p>
<p>The stock split will be distributed as a dividend to shareholders of record on Aug 18.  The actual distribution will occur on Sept 2, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Plantronics, a maker of communications headsets, said that upon completion of the stock split, it will have roughly 17 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
